{"t": 1793283047249, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "settled", "On founding, the warning 'Settlement founded. Fortressford and Littleford resent a new settlement so near their land.' (tick 5794) is replaced 8 ticks later by 'You are back on your own land. Objective complete...' (tick 5802), so the diplomatic consequence is never readable. Also the settlement's big floating name/'0/0 residents' label renders behind the Chronicle and status panels and cannot be read. Expected the warning to persist and the label not to collide with the HUD."]}
